{
  "name": "11a-Google-Sheets-CRUD-No-HTML",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📘 Master Class: Google Sheets Database (CRUD)\n\nWelcome to the backend! There are no HTML frontends today. We are focusing purely on data engineering and database logic.\n\n### 🎯 Your Mission\nTurn a simple Google Sheet into a living database. You will learn how to route data to Create, Read, Update, and Delete records.\n\n### 🛠️ Instructions\n1. Connect your **Google Sheets Credential** to the three nodes on the right.\n2. Point them to a sheet with the following exact columns: `Ticket ID`, `Name`, `Phone`, `Tour Date`.\n3. Open the **Mock Data Input** node. Change the `action` field to `insert`, `update`, or `delete`.\n4. Click the **Execute Workflow** button at the bottom of the screen and watch your sheet update instantly!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-lesson",
      "name": "Classroom Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 0, 0 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Execute Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 0, 420 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "mock1",
              "name": "action",
              "value": "insert",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "mock2",
              "name": "ticket_id",
              "value": "KKR-TICK-999",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "mock3",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "Rahul Sharma",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "mock4",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "+91 9876543210",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "mock5",
              "name": "tour_date",
              "value": "2026-08-15",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "mock-data",
      "name": "Mock Data Input (Edit Me!)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [ 240, 420 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [
                  { "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}", "rightValue": "insert", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [
                  { "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}", "rightValue": "update", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
                "conditions": [
                  { "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}", "rightValue": "delete", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "route-action",
      "name": "Route by Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [ 460, 420 ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID_HERE", "mode": "id" },
        "sheetName": { "__rl": true, "value": "Sheet1", "mode": "name" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Ticket ID": "={{ $json.ticket_id }}",
            "Name": "={{ $json.name }}",
            "Phone": "={{ $json.phone }}",
            "Tour Date": "={{ $json.tour_date }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheet-insert",
      "name": "Google Sheets (Insert)",
